{"id":"d162429782d1ee12c7d4dd9959b6fb9fc4ce6c57","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1242545","title":"macOS 27 有人遇到 appstoreagent 高 cpu 占用的问题吗","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"0619","excerpt":"macOS - @0619 -","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18094095\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/69ac/1689/92866_normal.png?m=1758436465\" alt=\"di11wei\" data-uid=\"92866\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/di11wei\">di11wei</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 04:37:14 +08:00\">17h 45m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>之前 beta 的时候遇到过，连带 dasd 进程一起高占用。目前是每周日上午 dasd 进程会高占用。<br>问 AI 给到的结果是 appstoreagent 在执行每周循环任务的时候因为每周开始日期计算错误陷入错误循环连带导致 dasd 进程高占用。<br>解决办法就是手动结束一下 appstoreagent 进程即可。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18097930\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/fee6/f8c8/194366_normal.png?m=1641003759\" alt=\"QQ842562342\" data-uid=\"194366\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/QQ842562342\">QQ842562342</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 21:11:49 +08:00\">1h 11m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我是 chronod 内存占用高动不动就去 1 ～ 2G 去了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div></DIV>","content_text":"1 di11wei 17h 45m ago via Android 之前 beta 的时候遇到过，连带 dasd 进程一起高占用。目前是每周日上午 dasd 进程会高占用。问 AI 给到的结果是 appstoreagent 在执行每周循环任务的时候因为每周开始日期计算错误陷入错误循环连带导致 dasd 进程高占用。解决办法就是手动结束一下 appstoreagent 进程即可。 2 QQ842562342 1h 11m ago 我是 chronod 内存占用高动不动就去 1 ～ 2G 去了","fetched_at":"2026-09-17T14:22:49.839Z","ok":true}